  Q("The antecedent will regards…",[["a thing considered in itself","Correct: q.19 a.6 ad 1."],["a thing with all its circumstances","That is consequent."],["God's will before creation","Not a temporal 'before'."],["evil","No."]],0,"ST I q.19 a.6",{bloom:"Remember",terms:["antecedent-will"],diff:2}),
  Q("CCC 1037 states that…",[["God predestines some to hell","It says the opposite."],["God predestines no one to go to hell","Correct."],["everyone is saved","Not taught."],["predestination is fate","No."]],1,"CCC 1037",{bloom:"Remember",terms:[],diff:1}),
  Q("God's will makes some effects contingent because…",[["it is weak","No."],["it is perfectly efficacious, so things happen in the way he wills them","Correct: q.19 a.8."],["he does not know them","He knows all."],["secondary causes resist him","No."]],1,"ST I q.19 a.8",{bloom:"Understand",terms:["secondary-cause"],diff:2}),
  Q("Which evil does God in no way will?",[["Natural defect","He wills it as attached to the order of nature."],["Punishment","He wills it as attached to justice."],["Sin","Correct: q.19 a.9. He permits it."],["Death of animals","Natural defect."]],2,"ST I q.19 a.9",{bloom:"Remember",terms:["evil-privation"],diff:2}),
  Q("Love is the first movement of the will because…",[["it is the strongest emotion","Not the reason."],["every other appetitive act presupposes love of some good","Correct: q.20 a.1."],["it comes first in time","No."],["Scripture names it first","No."]],1,"ST I q.20 a.1",{bloom:"Understand",terms:["love-divine"],diff:2}),
  Q("God loves the better things more because…",[["they attract him more","His love is not caused by its object."],["they are better because he wills them a greater good","Correct: q.20 a.4."],["he changes his mind","No."],["he loves with greater intensity","As to the act, his love is equal."]],1,"ST I q.20 a.4",{bloom:"Analyse",terms:["love-divine"],diff:3}),
  Q("Which justice does NOT belong to God?",[["Distributive","It does belong."],["Commutative","Correct: q.21 a.1, he receives nothing."],["Both","One belongs."],["Neither","One belongs."]],1,"ST I q.21 a.1",{bloom:"Remember",terms:["justice"],diff:1}),
  Q("Mercy is attributed to God…",[["as a feeling of sorrow","Not as passion."],["in its effect, dispelling misery","Correct: q.21 a.3."],["only in the Old Testament","No."],["metaphorically only","It is said properly, as to the effect."]],1,"ST I q.21 a.3",{bloom:"Remember",terms:["mercy"],diff:2})
